    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Instructions to use BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 with libraries, inference providers, notebooks, and local apps. Follow these links to get started.\n- Libraries\n- sentence-transformers How to use BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 with sentence-transformers: from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer model = SentenceTransformer(\"BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3\") sentences = [ \"The weather is lovely today.\", \"It's so sunny outside!\", \"He drove to the stadium.\" ] embeddings = model.encode(sentences) similarities = model.similarity(embeddings, embeddings) print(similarities.shape) # [3, 3]",
    "character_count": 579
