    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 14 Sep 2023 (v1), last revised 24 Sep 2024 (this version, v5)]\nTitle:C-Pack: Packed Resources For General Chinese Embeddings",
    "character_count": 182
