    "chunk_id": "1ad197a2-87b6-43ee-9bfd-ed82352e8093",
    "technology": "deepeval",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "path": "deepeval/official_documentation.txt",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "text": "-\nRAG Metrics- Answer Relevancy — measure how relevant the RAG pipeline's output is to the input\n- Faithfulness — evaluate whether the RAG pipeline's output factually aligns with the retrieval context\n- Contextual Recall — measure how well the RAG pipeline's retrieval context aligns with the expected output\n- Contextual Precision — evaluate whether relevant nodes in the RAG pipeline's retrieval context are ranked higher\n- Contextual Relevancy — measure the overall relevance of the RAG pipeline's retrieval context to the input\n- RAGAS — average of answer relevancy, faithfulness, contextual precision, and contextual recall",
    "character_count": 628
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "02ef1419-c6c4-4b9b-a24b-80d73433e084",
    "technology": "deepeval",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "path": "deepeval/official_documentation.txt",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "text": "-\nMulti-Turn Metrics- Knowledge Retention — evaluate whether the chatbot retains factual information throughout a conversation\n- Conversation Completeness — measure whether the chatbot satisfies user needs throughout a conversation\n- Turn Relevancy — evaluate whether the chatbot generates consistently relevant responses throughout a conversation\n- Turn Faithfulness — check if the chatbot's responses are factually grounded in retrieval context across turns\n- Role Adherence — evaluate whether the chatbot adheres to its assigned role throughout a conversation\n\n-\nMCP Metrics- MCP Task Completion — evaluate how effectively an MCP-based agent accomplishes a task\n- MCP Use — measure how effectively an agent uses its available MCP servers\n- Multi-Turn MCP Use — evaluate MCP server usage across conversation turns",
    "character_count": 815
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "c9c24291-b365-4024-98e7-33fdbd86fbf6",
    "technology": "deepeval",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "path": "deepeval/official_documentation.txt",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "text": "-\nMultimodal Metrics- Text to Image — evaluate image generation quality based on semantic consistency and perceptual quality\n- Image Editing — evaluate image editing quality based on semantic consistency and perceptual quality\n- Image Coherence — measure how well images align with their accompanying text\n- Image Helpfulness — evaluate how effectively images contribute to user comprehension of the text\n- Image Reference — evaluate how accurately images are referred to or explained by accompanying text",
    "character_count": 505
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "09d50cfb-7e36-4ced-b75b-a6f17a51d5da",
    "technology": "deepeval",
    "source": "official_documentation",
    "path": "deepeval/official_documentation.txt",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "text": "-\nOther Metrics- Hallucination — check whether the LLM generates factually correct information against provided context\n- Summarization — evaluate whether summaries are factually correct and include necessary details\n- Bias — detect gender, racial, or political bias in LLM outputs\n- Toxicity — evaluate toxicity in LLM outputs\n- JSON Correctness — check whether the output matches an expected JSON schema\n- Prompt Alignment — measure whether the output aligns with instructions in the prompt template",
    "character_count": 501
