    "text": "Releases: facebookresearch/faiss\nRelease list\nv1.14.3\nHighlights\n- Metal GPU backend expansion — new MetalIndexIVFFlatwith IVF scan/merge kernels and expanded top-k support (#5202); Metal now enabled by default on Apple Silicon machines (#5280)\n- TurboQuant in ScalarQuantizer — full Algorithm 2 (QJL stage) with SIMD and optimizations (#5170)\n- Sapphire Rapids (SPR) optimizations — ScalarQuantizer L2/IP (#5173), VPOPCNTDQ-based HammingComputer (#5183), and VPOPCNTDQ-based RaBitQ kernel (#5149)\n- faiss-gpu pip wheels — new GPU wheel packaging (#5131); musllinux wheels re-enabled for faiss-cpu (#5299)\n- SVS static vamana support (#5224)\n- HNSW is_similaritymode for IP/similarity metrics (#5246, #5226)\n- HNSW search performance — reserve VisitedTableSetcapacity to avoid rehashes (#5290),search_from_candidate_unboundedtemplatized forVisitedTabledevirtualization (#5270), and runtime checks avoided inVisitedTable(#5234)",
