    "text": "v1beta. The total_reasoning_tokensfield has been renamed tototal_thought_tokensto better align with the concept of \"thoughts\" in thinking models.\nDecember 17, 2025\n- Launched Gemini 3 Flash Preview, - gemini-3-flash-preview, delivering fast frontier-class performance that rivals larger models at a fraction of the cost. With upgraded visual and spatial reasoning, and agentic coding capabilities. Read the documentation on some new features, including:\nDecember 12, 2025\n- Released gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025, a new native audio model for the Live API. This update improves the model's ability to handle complex workflows. To learn more, see the Live API guide and Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio.\nDecember 11, 2025\n- Launched the Interactions API. This API provides a unified interface for interacting with Gemini models and agents. To learn more, see the Interactions API guide.",
