    "text": "- Released the\ngemini-2.5-pro-preview-ttsandgemini-2.5-flash-preview-ttsmodels, which are capable of generating speech with one or two speakers.\n- Released the lyria-realtime-expmodel, which generates music in real time.\n- Released gemini-2.5-flash-preview-native-audio-dialogandgemini-2.5-flash-exp-native-audio-thinking-dialog, new Gemini models for the Live API with native audio output capabilities. To learn more, see the Live API guide and Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio.\n- Released gemma-3n-e4b-itpreview, available on AI Studio and through the Gemini API, as part of the Gemma 3n launch.\nMay 7, 2025\n- Released gemini-2.0-flash-preview-image-generation, a preview model for generating and editing images. To learn more, see Image generation and Gemini 2.0 Flash Preview Image Generation.\nMay 6, 2025",
