    "text": "folder_special\nFeatured\nschool\nAcademic Publications\narXiv\nSIGIR 2026\nICLR 2026\narXiv\nICLR 2026\nAAAI 2026\nNeurIPS 2025\nEMNLP 2025\nICLR 2025\nACL 2025\nICLR 2025\nECIR 2025\nSIGIR 2025\nEMNLP 2024\nWWW 2025\nICML 2024\narXiv\narXiv\nEMNLP 2023\n19 publications in total.\nchevron_leftchevron_right",
