    "chunk_index": 4,
    "text": "- Contributing Guide – Learn how to contribute to LangChain projects and find good first issues.\n- Code of Conduct – Our community guidelines and standards for participation.\nLangGraph is inspired by Pregel and Apache Beam. The public interface draws inspiration from NetworkX. LangGraph is built by LangChain Inc, the creators of LangChain, but can be used without LangChain.",
