    "chunk_index": 2,
    "text": "| Observability Capture complete traces of your LLM applications and agents for deep behavioral insights. Built on OpenTelemetry, supporting any LLM provider and agent framework. Monitor production quality, costs, and safety. Getting Started → Try Demo → | Evaluation Run systematic evaluations, track quality metrics over time, and catch regressions before they reach production. Choose from 50+ built-in metrics and LLM judges, or define your own. Getting Started → Try Demo → |\n| Prompts & Optimization Version, test, and deploy prompts with full lineage tracking. Automatically optimize prompts with state-of-the-art algorithms to improve performance. Getting Started → Try Demo → | AI Gateway Unified API gateway for all LLM providers. Route requests, manage rate limits, handle fallbacks, and control costs through an OpenAI-compatible interface with built-in credential management, guardrails and traffic splitting for A/B testing. Getting Started → |",
    "character_count": 958
  },
  {
