    "path": "sentence_transformers/api_reference.txt",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "text": "- modules (list[nn.Module], optional) – A list of torch modules that are called sequentially. Can be used to create custom models from scratch. Defaults to None.\n- device (str, optional) – Device (like - \"cuda\",- \"cpu\",- \"mps\",- \"npu\") that should be used for computation. If None, checks if a GPU can be used. If a- device_mapis provided via- model_kwargs, that controls device placement and this argument is ignored. Defaults to None.\n- prompts (dict[str, str], optional) – A dictionary with prompts for the model. The key is the prompt name, the value is the prompt text. The prompt text will be prepended before any text during inference. For example: - {\"query\": \"query: \", \"passage\": \"passage: \"}. If a model has saved prompts, you can override them by passing your own, or pass- {\"query\": \"\", \"document\": \"\"}to disable them. Defaults to None.",
    "character_count": 849
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "a390639e-6a05-4d8e-8657-d364788c9ab0",
