    "chunk_index": 1,
    "text": "The Agent Development Kit (ADK) is a modular, model-agnostic framework designed to make building and deploying complex AI agents feel just like standard software development.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExplore Google's library of pre-built agents.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLow-code canvas for designing complex multi-agent reasoning loops.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSkill Registry serves as a secure, private, and low-latency repository for managing and discovering agent skills.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRAG Engine helps you securely connect your private data to LLMs, reducing hallucinations and improving answer accuracy by providing the model with relevant, context-rich information.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVector Search is an AI-native search engine that combines storage and retrieval into one scalable, auto-tuned platform, simplifying how you store, search, and manage your data for AI applications.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nA config-driven, REST-first API for building autonomous agents inside a fully managed sandbox.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScale",
