    "text": "Query Profiling: See Where a Slow Query Spends Its Time\nQuery Profiling: See Where a Slow Query Spends Its Time\nWhen a Weaviate query is slow, the first question is where the time went. Query profiling returns a per-stage, per-shard timing breakdown, making query performance issues visible.",
