    "chunk_index": 0,
    "text": "Computer Science > Computation and Language\n[Submitted on 3 Sep 2021 (v1), last revised 8 Feb 2022 (this version, v5)]\nTitle:Finetuned Language Models Are Zero-Shot Learners\nView PDFAbstract:This paper explores a simple method for improving the zero-shot learning abilities of language models. We show that instruction tuning -- finetuning language models on a collection of tasks described via instructions -- substantially improves zero-shot performance on unseen tasks.",
    "character_count": 472
